units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p m
atom_style atomic
run_style verlet
lattice bcc 3.3 origin 0 0 0 orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1
region whole block 0 66 0 66 0 313 units box
create_box 1 whole
region proj0 block 0 20 0 20 0 20 units lattice
region targ0 block 0 20 0 20 0 40 units lattice
create_atoms 1 region proj0
group projectile region proj0
create_atoms 1 region targ0
group target subtract all projectile
pair_style eam/fs
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
mass 1 92.90637
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001
compute ttarget target temp/com
compute tprojectile projectile temp/com
velocity target create 300 4928459 temp ttarget mom yes rot no dist gaussian
velocity projectile create 300 9847261 temp tprojectile mom yes rot no dist gaussian
fix eq1 target nvt temp 300 300 0.1
fix eq2 projectile nvt temp 300 300 0.1
fix_modify eq1 temp ttarget
fix_modify eq2 temp tprojectile
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step time atoms c_ttarget c_tprojectile pe ke etotal lx ly lz
thermo_modify flush yes lost warn norm no
dump 1 all custom 1000 dump.nb_spall.lammpstrj id type x y z vx vy vz
dump_modify 1 sort id
run 100000
velocity target zero linear
velocity projectile zero linear
velocity projectile set 0 0 20 sum yes units box
fix prod all nve
run 100000
